title: Shuffle Leadership
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: shuffle_leadership_timer = 0 and difficulty >= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; shuffle_leadership_timer = 8;
card-image: img/vorwarts_2.jpg
go-to: rm_main

# generated by scripts/gen_advisors.py from one table of advisors

Changing the people around the party leadership is painful, but perhaps it is necessary to adapt to changing circumstances.

Removing advisors will increase dissent in their faction of the party, while selecting advisors will increase a faction's strength.

- @rm_main: Remove advisors
- @add_advisors: Add advisors
- @remove_none: Don't change advisors.
- @easy_discard

###################### removing advisors

@rm_main
title: Remove advisors.
tags: center_advisor, left_advisor, reformist_advisor, labor_advisor, nonfactional_advisor
frequency: 1

- #remove_advisor
- @add_advisors: Add advisors

@remove_none
title: Stop changing advisors.
go-to: root
tags: remove_advisor

@remove_miersch
title: Remove Miersch
view-if: miersch_advisor = 1
tags: remove_advisor
on-arrival: miersch_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1; left_dissent += 5
go-to: rm_main

Matthias Miersch is no longer an advisor. The Parlamentarische Linke disapproves.

